"Baseline protection level (BBN) as assigned by the Handreiking BIO2-opmaat v2.5 (transition document). Applies broadly to baseline controls: both bio:BIOControl (ISO 27002-based) and bio:OverheidsMaatregel (government-specific). BBN is NOT defined in BIO 2.0 itself, only in the Handreiking. Valid values: 1 (baseline) and 2 (elevated). BBN 3 does not exist in this source."@en owl:sameAs "Baseline protection level (BBN) as assigned by the Handreiking BIO2-opmaat v2.5 (transition document). Applies broadly to baseline controls: both bio:BIOControl (ISO 27002-based) and bio:OverheidsMaatregel (government-specific). BBN is NOT defined in BIO 2.0 itself, only in the Handreiking. Valid values: 1 (baseline) and 2 (elevated). BBN 3 does not exist in this source."@en .

