"D12 legal layer (v4.3.3): concrete legal obligation at article level, typically with dual compl:derivedFrom to EU directive + NL transposition law. Masterchat-confirmed typing correlation: dual derivedFrom ⇒ RegulatoryObligation; single derivedFrom (EU only) ⇒ plain compl:ComplianceRequirement subclass."@en owl:sameAs "D12 legal layer (v4.3.3): concrete legal obligation at article level, typically with dual compl:derivedFrom to EU directive + NL transposition law. Masterchat-confirmed typing correlation: dual derivedFrom ⇒ RegulatoryObligation; single derivedFrom (EU only) ⇒ plain compl:ComplianceRequirement subclass."@en .

"D12 obligation layer (v4.3.3): legal grouping below article level, linked via compl:derivedFrom chain to compl:RegulatoryObligation (legal layer) and to framework-specific compl:ComplianceRequirement subclasses (requirement layer)."@en owl:sameAs "D12 obligation layer (v4.3.3): legal grouping below article level, linked via compl:derivedFrom chain to compl:RegulatoryObligation (legal layer) and to framework-specific compl:ComplianceRequirement subclasses (requirement layer)."@en .

"D12 requirement layer (v4.3.3): operational translation of a statutory NIS2 obligation, carrying compl:hasStatus, compl:satisfiedBy, compl:belongsToDomain and compl:requirementText. Subjects with single compl:derivedFrom (NIS2_Directive only) remain on this class; subjects also nationally enforceable via CBW (art. 21(2)) sit on compl:RegulatoryObligation (D12 legal layer)."@en owl:sameAs "D12 requirement layer (v4.3.3): operational translation of a statutory NIS2 obligation, carrying compl:hasStatus, compl:satisfiedBy, compl:belongsToDomain and compl:requirementText. Subjects with single compl:derivedFrom (NIS2_Directive only) remain on this class; subjects also nationally enforceable via CBW (art. 21(2)) sit on compl:RegulatoryObligation (D12 legal layer)."@en .

