"General Data Protection Regulation. In this model only the information security interface articles: art. 5(1)(f) integrity and confidentiality, art. 25 data protection by design and by default, art. 32 security of processing, art. 33 notification of breach to supervisory authority, art. 34 communication of breach to data subject."@en owl:sameAs "General Data Protection Regulation. In this model only the information security interface articles: art. 5(1)(f) integrity and confidentiality, art. 25 data protection by design and by default, art. 32 security of processing, art. 33 notification of breach to supervisory authority, art. 34 communication of breach to data subject."@en .

"General administrative order (AMvB) implementing the Cyberbeveiligingswet (CBW). Chapter 4 (Duty of Care) contains 14 substantive duty-of-care articles (art. 6 to 19) that operationally elaborate the NIS2 art. 21 measures for essential and important entities. Art. 18 contains a separate ministerial competence (supplier exclusion order). Status May 2026: concept for the House of Representatives, not yet adopted; entry into force by royal decree."@en owl:sameAs "General administrative order (AMvB) implementing the Cyberbeveiligingswet (CBW). Chapter 4 (Duty of Care) contains 14 substantive duty-of-care articles (art. 6 to 19) that operationally elaborate the NIS2 art. 21 measures for essential and important entities. Art. 18 contains a separate ministerial competence (supplier exclusion order). Status May 2026: concept for the House of Representatives, not yet adopted; entry into force by royal decree."@en .

