"LAYER 5 SCOPE NOTE (Action E, 2026-04-10) — Cross-framework SKOS mappings: the actual count is 331 (starting point for Layer 5 quality analysis, not a volume target). The NIST 800-53 → ISO 27001 bulk import from sp800-53r5-to-iso-27001-mapping.docx is explicitly Layer 5+ work, not in Layer 5 itself, to avoid drowning the quality analysis in NIST bulk. SKOS asymmetry (broadMatch ↔ narrowMatch, exactMatch/relatedMatch symmetry) will be detected and systematically fixed in Layer 5."@en owl:sameAs "LAYER 5 SCOPE NOTE (Action E, 2026-04-10) — Cross-framework SKOS mappings: the actual count is 331 (starting point for Layer 5 quality analysis, not a volume target). The NIST 800-53 → ISO 27001 bulk import from sp800-53r5-to-iso-27001-mapping.docx is explicitly Layer 5+ work, not in Layer 5 itself, to avoid drowning the quality analysis in NIST bulk. SKOS asymmetry (broadMatch ↔ narrowMatch, exactMatch/relatedMatch symmetry) will be detected and systematically fixed in Layer 5."@en .

