"NIST CSF 2.0 Reference Tool export (csf2.xlsx, generated 19 May 2026), contains Informative References from 23 framework sources at CSF Function/Category/Subcategory level. Per sub-choice C1 v4.5.0 only SP 800-53 Rev 5.2.0 (746 refs), ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A Controls (301 refs) and ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Mandatory Clause (188 refs) included. 20 other source-prefixes (NICE Framework, CCMv4.0, PCI DSS, etc.) not included — out of C1 scope. Public domain. NOTE: this is not an OLIR-snapshot XLSX (no explicit equivalent/subset/intersects relationship types); all mappings converted as skos:closeMatch."@en a rdfs:Literal ;
    owl:sameAs "NIST CSF 2.0 Reference Tool export (csf2.xlsx, generated 19 May 2026), contains Informative References from 23 framework sources at CSF Function/Category/Subcategory level. Per sub-choice C1 v4.5.0 only SP 800-53 Rev 5.2.0 (746 refs), ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Annex A Controls (301 refs) and ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Mandatory Clause (188 refs) included. 20 other source-prefixes (NICE Framework, CCMv4.0, PCI DSS, etc.) not included — out of C1 scope. Public domain. NOTE: this is not an OLIR-snapshot XLSX (no explicit equivalent/subset/intersects relationship types); all mappings converted as skos:closeMatch."@en .

