"Perform hardware disposal in a secure, responsible, and auditable manner"@en owl:sameAs "Perform hardware disposal in a secure, responsible, and auditable manner"@en .

"Perform penetration testing to identify opportunities to improve the security posture of selected high-risk systems as approved by leadership"@en owl:sameAs "Perform penetration testing to identify opportunities to improve the security posture of selected high-risk systems as approved by leadership"@en .

"Perform routine and emergency patching within the timeframes specified in the vulnerability management plan"@en owl:sameAs "Perform routine and emergency patching within the timeframes specified in the vulnerability management plan"@en .

"Perform self-assessments of critical services that take current threats and TTPs into consideration"@en owl:sameAs "Perform self-assessments of critical services that take current threats and TTPs into consideration"@en .

"Perform thorough due diligence on prospective suppliers that is consistent with procurement planning and commensurate with the level of risk, criticality, and complexity of each supplier relationship"@en owl:sameAs "Perform thorough due diligence on prospective suppliers that is consistent with procurement planning and commensurate with the level of risk, criticality, and complexity of each supplier relationship"@en .

"Perform threat hunting to look for signs of threat actors within the environment"@en owl:sameAs "Perform threat hunting to look for signs of threat actors within the environment"@en .

