"Periodic formal report to governing bodies on ISMS / GRC performance, as required by ISO 27001:2022 Clause 9.3."@en owl:sameAs "Periodic formal report to governing bodies on ISMS / GRC performance, as required by ISO 27001:2022 Clause 9.3."@en .

"Periodically assess or test users on their understanding of basic cybersecurity practices"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically assess or test users on their understanding of basic cybersecurity practices"@en .

"Periodically assess or test users on their understanding of cybersecurity practices for their specialized roles"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically assess or test users on their understanding of cybersecurity practices for their specialized roles"@en .

"Periodically identify redundant systems, hardware, software, and services that unnecessarily increase the organization’s attack surface"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically identify redundant systems, hardware, software, and services that unnecessarily increase the organization’s attack surface"@en .

"Periodically provide risk reporting to leaders about how acquired components are proven to be untampered and authentic"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically provide risk reporting to leaders about how acquired components are proven to be untampered and authentic"@en .

"Periodically reauthenticate users, services, and hardware based on risk (e.g., in zero trust architectures)"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically reauthenticate users, services, and hardware based on risk (e.g., in zero trust architectures)"@en .

"Periodically review policy and supporting processes and procedures to ensure that they align with risk management strategy objectives and priorities, as well as the high-level direction of the cybersecurity policy"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically review policy and supporting processes and procedures to ensure that they align with risk management strategy objectives and priorities, as well as the high-level direction of the cybersecurity policy"@en .

"Periodically review risks that were accepted based upon planned future actions or milestones"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically review risks that were accepted based upon planned future actions or milestones"@en .

"Periodically review the privileges associated with critical business functions to confirm proper separation of duties"@en owl:sameAs "Periodically review the privileges associated with critical business functions to confirm proper separation of duties"@en .

