"REASONING REQUIREMENT (v4.2.0, 2026-04-13) — The BIO asset mappings (M18) are derived via owl:sameAs inference from grc-bridges.ttl (D5). This inference works ONLY under a reasoner that supports OWL RL or stronger: HermiT (OWL DL, used in Protégé), owlrl.OWLRL_Semantics (rdflib/pySHACL), or GraphDB OWL-Horst. Pure RDFS inference makes 128 BIO mappings invisible — critical fault."@en owl:sameAs "REASONING REQUIREMENT (v4.2.0, 2026-04-13) — The BIO asset mappings (M18) are derived via owl:sameAs inference from grc-bridges.ttl (D5). This inference works ONLY under a reasoner that supports OWL RL or stronger: HermiT (OWL DL, used in Protégé), owlrl.OWLRL_Semantics (rdflib/pySHACL), or GraphDB OWL-Horst. Pure RDFS inference makes 128 BIO mappings invisible — critical fault."@en .

