"The Security Coordinator (BVC) is the designated officer for information security at the level of a service unit. Legal basis: Besluit BVA-stelsel Rijksdienst 2021, art. 6. Functional reporting line to the BVA; hierarchical reporting line to the service unit. BVC is a different role from the CISO (CIO-stelsel, organisation level)."@en owl:sameAs "The Security Coordinator (BVC) is the designated officer for information security at the level of a service unit. Legal basis: Besluit BVA-stelsel Rijksdienst 2021, art. 6. Functional reporting line to the BVA; hierarchical reporting line to the service unit. BVC is a different role from the CISO (CIO-stelsel, organisation level)."@en .

"The acceptable variation in outcomes related to specific performance measures. Operationalises risk appetite at process or system level. [ISO 31000:2018]"@en owl:sameAs "The acceptable variation in outcomes related to specific performance measures. Operationalises risk appetite at process or system level. [ISO 31000:2018]"@en .

"The amount and type of risk an organisation is willing to pursue or retain in order to achieve its objectives. [ISO 31000:2018 §3.28 / COBIT 2019]"@en owl:sameAs "The amount and type of risk an organisation is willing to pursue or retain in order to achieve its objectives. [ISO 31000:2018 §3.28 / COBIT 2019]"@en .

