"The article or clause number in the source instrument (e.g. 'Art. 21 NIS2')."@en owl:sameAs "The article or clause number in the source instrument (e.g. 'Art. 21 NIS2')."@en .

"The assessed status of a compliance requirement at a point in time."@en owl:sameAs "The assessed status of a compliance requirement at a point in time."@en .

"The authenticity and integrity of hardware and software are assessed prior to acquisition and use"@en owl:sameAs "The authenticity and integrity of hardware and software are assessed prior to acquisition and use"@en .

