"Update the inventory when a new external service is going to be utilized to ensure adequate cybersecurity risk management monitoring of the organization’s use of that service"@en owl:sameAs "Update the inventory when a new external service is going to be utilized to ensure adequate cybersecurity risk management monitoring of the organization’s use of that service"@en .

