"Use business impact and system categorization records (including service delivery objectives) to validate that essential services are restored in the appropriate order"@en owl:sameAs "Use business impact and system categorization records (including service delivery objectives) to validate that essential services are restored in the appropriate order"@en .

"Use cyber threat intelligence to maintain awareness of the types of threat actors likely to target the organization and the TTPs they are likely to use"@en owl:sameAs "Use cyber threat intelligence to maintain awareness of the types of threat actors likely to target the organization and the TTPs they are likely to use"@en .

"Use cybersecurity software to generate alerts and provide them to the security operations center (SOC), incident responders, and incident response tools"@en owl:sameAs "Use cybersecurity software to generate alerts and provide them to the security operations center (SOC), incident responders, and incident response tools"@en .

"Use encryption, digital signatures, and cryptographic hashes to protect the confidentiality and integrity of network communications"@en owl:sameAs "Use encryption, digital signatures, and cryptographic hashes to protect the confidentiality and integrity of network communications"@en .

"Use encryption, digital signatures, and cryptographic hashes to protect the confidentiality and integrity of stored data in files, databases, virtual machine disk images, container images, and other resources"@en owl:sameAs "Use encryption, digital signatures, and cryptographic hashes to protect the confidentiality and integrity of stored data in files, databases, virtual machine disk images, container images, and other resources"@en .

