"WORKING RULE D6 (piggyback rule, established Action G, 2026-04-10) — Bilingualism: on each edit to a module file, all Dutch-only rdfs:comment and rdfs:label in that same file are updated to bilingual (@nl + @en) in the same commit. New classes, properties and individuals are always bilingual from the outset. This rule distributes the translation debt naturally over future edits rather than as a separate cleanup sprint."@en owl:sameAs "WORKING RULE D6 (piggyback rule, established Action G, 2026-04-10) — Bilingualism: on each edit to a module file, all Dutch-only rdfs:comment and rdfs:label in that same file are updated to bilingual (@nl + @en) in the same commit. New classes, properties and individuals are always bilingual from the outset. This rule distributes the translation debt naturally over future edits rather than as a separate cleanup sprint."@en .

